                "message": "✨ feat: lint and strip quotes around the litnote pub-title\n\nThe batch fill reports a pub-title enclosed in quotes as its own category and\nremoves them; the BibTeX title is read without enclosing quotes so updates do\nnot bring them back; sp-litnotes-meta-title-lint-dryrun/-convert check titles\nof notes without a BibTeX entry too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAsmZG5tiGhctahjhB",
